!!! 14-cross-language-app.matrix  --  page 3 of 3
!!!
!!! The entry point. This Matrix book reads BOTH earlier pages and uses them
!!! without caring which surface declared what:
!!!
!!!   - it calls 'scale', a paragraph declared in Ny;
!!!   - it constructs Measurement, a record declared in Matrix, and also
!!!     receives one built by Ny's 'describe';
!!!   - it constructs OffsetSampler, a class declared in Ny that derives from
!!!     Sampler, a class declared in Matrix, and dispatches virtually through
!!!     a Matrix-typed ancestor view of it.
!!!
!!! Note how the Ny names are spelled. An Ny declaration's own spelling is the
!!! NIL symbol, so Matrix writes 'ny_helper' with its underscore and
!!! 'OffsetSampler' with its capitals. Matrix-internal names fold case; a name
!!! declared in Ny does not, because Ny is case-sensitive and its spelling is
!!! the one in the artifact.

book tour.app

read tour.mixed
read tour.ny_helper


!!! Calling across the boundary in both directions within one paragraph: an Ny
!!! paragraph supplies the value, a Matrix record carries it back.
public summarise receives raw as number returns Measurement begin paragraph
    value adjusted is tour.ny_helper::scale with input being raw
    give build Measurement with sensor being "primary", reading being adjusted
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph

    !!! Matrix -> Ny: a paragraph call.
    value doubled is tour.ny_helper::scale with input being 21
    say doubled

    !!! Matrix -> Ny -> Matrix: an Ny paragraph returns a Matrix record.
    value from-ny is tour.ny_helper::describe with reading being 84
    say from-ny.sensor
    say from-ny.reading

    !!! A Matrix record built in Matrix, carrying a value computed in Ny.
    value result is summarise with raw being 20
    say result.sensor
    say result.reading

    !!! An Ny class deriving from a Matrix class, viewed as the Matrix base.
    !!! The override declared in Ny is selected through a Matrix-typed view.
    value derived is build tour.ny_helper::OffsetSampler with offset being 1, bonus being 1
    value viewed as Sampler is derived
    say viewed.sample with raw being 40

    !!! The Matrix base on its own, for comparison: no bonus is added.
    value base is build Sampler with offset being 2
    say base.sample with raw being 40

    give 0
end paragraph
